    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na obororo buna obw’omokuungu okobina aibore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, buna koreng’ana endo egosoka korwa ase rinani rinoru ria Yorodani, erinde yagenda goita ching’ondi chire ime ase obweri obokong’u, naboigo na inche ndachiere abanto ba Babiloni mobosokano, mbaserie batame korwa aroro. Onde bwensi ndachore nimobeke abe omorisia igoro ase bare. Ning’o oranyare koreng’anigwa nainche? Ning’o orambekere rituko indue omobaro? Morisia ki oranyare kweegera ase obosio bwane?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, tegerera moigwe omooroberio inche Omonene nakorire igoro y’abanto ba Babiloni, na okogania kwane mbwate igoro y’ense y’Abakalidayo. Ekeene, nonya nabana babo mbakururwe buna chimanwa chi’eching’ondi chigokururwa chiairwa. Ee, ekeene, ense yabo nebaichanere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Babiloni orabwatwe, ense netengechigwe, na eriogi riaye narigugwe ase egati y’ebisaku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
